# Into the game itself: confirm the empty name, PLAY, START NEW GAME, and then the jungle.
#
# This is the picture oracle's case (tests/frames.sh). It exists because the call-log oracle was
# identical to the emulator's for every one of these frames while the whole scene rendered as
# colour noise: the scene backgrounds are 320x240 paletted textures in a format the uploader was
# decoding as if its palette entries were twice the size they are.
#
# A menu row is eight detents, so -24 walks the highlight three items left, onto the tick.
440: select
480: wheel -24
520: select
620: select
760: select
900: shot
1400: shot
2000: shot
2800: shot
3600: shot
3620: quit
